  "description": "gRPC transport binding and strongly typed client for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Data. Exposes the read-write external data-plane API (set, delete, non-atomic bulk upsert, single-tree and cross-tree atomic batches, point read, bounded range read, bounded range delete, and the typed CRDT write and read verbs) as unary gRPC RPCs over a code-first, Orleans-serialized contract, with a header-based identity bridge, a pluggable coarse authorization seam, and a default-deny posture. Registered with AddLatticeDataApiGrpc(...) and mapped with MapLatticeDataApiGrpc().",
